SUMMARY:🎟️ 备选：Waikīkī 日落帆船
DESCRIPTION:日落帆船可以安排在今天或1/7，看出发前的天气
 和海况，哪天风浪小、云少就选哪天。选今天的话，16:30
 到海滩上船点，17:00–19:00出海；时差刚倒，累的话就留
 给1/7。不坐船就在Kūhiō Beach散步看日落（1月约18:05）。\
 n\n🚶 路程：从 Hotel Renew 步行约 10 分钟\n\n📍 Kūhiō Beach
 \, Honolulu\, Kalākaua Ave\, Waikīkī\n🧭 https://www.google.com/maps/
 dir/?api=1&destination=K%C5%ABhi%C5%8D%20Beach%2C%20Honolulu\nMoana Sailin
 g 订票: https://www.hawaiiactivities.com/en/hawaii/oahu/a/166886
LOCATION:Kūhiō Beach\, Honolulu\, Kalākaua Ave\, Waikīkī
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=K%C5%ABhi%C5%8D%20Be
 ach%2C%20Honolulu
