SUMMARY:🎟️ 古兰尼牧场 Jurassic Adventure
DESCRIPTION:10:40左右到牧场签到。坐越野车进Kualoa、Hakipuʻu
 、Kaʻaʻawa三条山谷，看《侏罗纪公园》《侏罗纪世界》
 等拍摄地。路面颠簸，只有短距离步行。场次要提前订
 。\n\n🚗 路程：从 Hoʻomaluhia Botanical Garden 开车约 30 分钟
 （20 公里）\n\n📍 Kualoa Ranch\, 49-560 Kamehameha Hwy\, Kāneʻohe\
 n🧭 https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=Kualoa%20Ranch\nK
 ualoa官方: https://www.kualoa.com/tours/
LOCATION:Kualoa Ranch\, 49-560 Kamehameha Hwy\, Kāneʻohe
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=Kualoa%20Ranch
GEO:21.5208318;-157.8372577
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS="49-560 Kamehameha Hwy, Kā
 neʻohe";X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Kualoa Ranch":geo:21.5208318,-157.837
 2577
END:VEVENT
