SUMMARY:🍽️ Giovanni's 蒜蓉虾饭
DESCRIPTION:午餐。排队太长就换旁边的Romy's或Fumi's。之后沿
 Kamehameha Hwy往西开，经过鲨鱼湾和威美亚湾时在车上看一
 眼就好：冬天下午北岸浪大，不专门停。\n\n🚗 路程：
 从 Kualoa Ranch 开车约 35 分钟（25 公里）\n\n📍 Giovanni's Shr
 imp Truck\, Kahuku\, 56-505 Kamehameha Hwy\, Kahuku\n🧭 https://www.goog
 le.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=Giovanni's%20Shrimp%20Truck%2C%20Kahuku
LOCATION:Giovanni's Shrimp Truck\, Kahuku\, 56-505 Kamehameha Hwy\, Kahuku
